  "nameEn": "Zigzag across the Square",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk the path for 8 steps. Before a tree try right, otherwise turn the robot left. Repair sparking lamps and light them all.",
  "descriptionEn": "The square path goes in steps: one step sideways — one step up. The turns alternate, and the sparking lamps need repairing.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk the path for 8 steps. Before a tree try right, otherwise turn the robot left. Only repair sparking lamps and turn off the working ones."
